     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<p>The name ZOLLER stands for quality and precision worldwide - and for good reason. We only use high-quality materials and brand-name components, which are the best prerequisites for exact results. </p> <p>Combined with sophisticated ZOLLER software, precision is achieved in every production process, regardless of user. Simple machine control and a high degree of automation ensures everyone from trainees to experienced employees can produce quality products.</p> <p>The result? Your production processes run smoothly so you can deliver the best quality products to your customers on time, with complete documentation.</p>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c3275",
      "bg": "",
