    "before": "none",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> ZOLLER on-site calibrations keep quality high </h2>",
   "body": "<p>ZOLLER was accredited by the German accreditation body DAkkS in May 2020, making it the only manufacturer of presetting and measuring machines to have the competence according to DIN EN ISO/IEC 17025:2018 to carry out calibrations in the field of dimensional measured variables for coordinate measuring technology at ZOLLER presetting and measuring machines on site.</p> <p>Customers can ensure the high quality of end products by calibrating their presetting and measuring machines in accordance with DIN EN ISO/IEC 17025:2018.</p> <p><strong>Advantages of ZOLLER on-site calibration:</strong></p><ul><li>Your measuring machine remains on site and is always available </li><li>Measurement values are recorded under their usual environmental conditions</li><li>Traceable calibration is provided in accordance with DIN EN ISO/IEC 17025:2018, which can only be ensured by an accredited calibration laboratory</li><li>International recognition of the accredited service and measurement results</li></ul><p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"mailto:serviceplanung@zoller-d.com?subject=Termin%20f%C3%BCr%20Vor-Ort-Kalibrierung%20vereinbaren&amp;body=Bitte%20rufen%20Sie%20mich%20an%3A%0AVorname%3A%20%0AName%3A%20%0AFirma%3A%20%0ATel.-Nr.%3A\" title=\"Zur Serviceplanung\"><strong>Arrange an appointment for on-site calibration</strong></a></p> <p>You are also welcome to call Mr. Timo Metsch: +49 7144 8970-392</p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/b/6/csm_genius_versprechen_v2_a210dd8875.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1454,
     "h": 1454
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c3272",
   "bg": "lightgray",
   "space": {
    "before": "default",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> The future is coming. Be ready for Industry 4.0. </h2>",
   "body": "<p>ZOLLER aims to deliver premium products and excellent service. Alongside innovation and service, quality is a cornerstone of our corporate identity. We underline our quality awareness and the associated quality and environmental policy with accreditation by DAkkS and certifications in accordance with ISO 9001, ISO 14001 and VDA 6.4 as well as an energy audit in accordance with DIN EN 16247-1.</p> <p>You'll get proven and tested electrical and mechanical safety, monitored production, and the confirmation that ZOLLER machines deliver what they promise to millions of satisfied customers - and external testing institutes.</p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/3/3/csm_pombasic_versprechen_b4a087dd41.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1454,
     "h": 1454
    }
   ],
